Scope and third-party components

This MIT license applies to this project's independent original code, build
scripts, configuration, documentation and examples. Upstream sources, content
derived from them and bundled third-party components retain their own licenses,
obligations and notices. The package's PyPI license metadata is MIT.

The wheel contains the following upstream components:

- mysqlclient 2.2.7 / 2.3.0: GPL-2.0-or-later.
  https://github.com/PyMySQL/mysqlclient/blob/v2.2.7/LICENSE
  https://github.com/PyMySQL/mysqlclient/blob/v2.3.0/pyproject.toml
- MariaDB Connector/C 3.4.11: LGPL-2.1-or-later.
  https://github.com/mariadb-corporation/mariadb-connector-c/blob/v3.4.11/COPYING.LIB
- OpenSSL 3.5.9: Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/openssl-3.5.9/LICENSE.txt
- zlib 1.3.2: zlib license.
  https://github.com/madler/zlib/blob/v1.3.2/LICENSE
- zstd 1.5.7: BSD-3-Clause is selected for this build. Upstream also offers
  GPL-2.0; both upstream license files are retained.
  https://github.com/facebook/zstd/blob/v1.5.7/LICENSE
  https://github.com/facebook/zstd/blob/v1.5.7/COPYING

Component notices and full GPL-3.0, LGPL-2.1 and Apache-2.0 texts are retained
in licenses/ and in the wheel's license directory. Corresponding source
